{"4759860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Duskvein Survivors - Bloodline", "steam_appid": 4759860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duskvein Survivors – Bloodline</strong> is a dark fantasy bullet-heaven roguelite about cursed blood, escalating arenas, and overwhelming hordes from the dusk rifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a chain of deadly arenas, collect experience gems, unlock new weapons, and shape your build through upgrades and bloodline powers. Each arena grows more dangerous, forcing you to become stronger before the next portal opens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your survivor, carve through waves of cursed enemies, defeat elites and bosses, and push your bloodline deeper into the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fast-paced survivors-like combat with automatic weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple cursed arenas connected through portal progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dark fantasy enemies, elites, and boss encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Weapon upgrades, passive boosts, and bloodline-style progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Short, intense runs built around escalating pressure</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duskvein Survivors – Bloodline</strong> is a dark fantasy bullet-heaven roguelite about cursed blood, escalating arenas, and overwhelming hordes from the dusk rifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a chain of deadly arenas, collect experience gems, unlock new weapons, and shape your build through upgrades and bloodline powers. Each arena grows more dangerous, forcing you to become stronger before the next portal opens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"